Subject: [PATCH] compat: migrate alias names to OCaml 5.5 AST


diff --git a/src/ppx_deriving_yojson.ml b/src/ppx_deriving_yojson.ml
index c933ca2..1a75cdb 100644
--- a/src/ppx_deriving_yojson.ml
